notes.content:
[h2] Hello adventurous farmers! [/h2]

[h3] Here's a first patch to fix the most annoying bugs.[/h3]

In this update, we:
[list]
[*] Fixed the saving system;
[*] Fixed farming system;
[*] Fixed chest storage issues;
[*] Made the enemy attack impossible during conversation;
[*] Fixed interaction distance;
[*] Fixed bees going into the tunnel;
[*] Adjusted inventory slot boundaries;
[*] Fixed spawning, depth and collisions;
[*] ...and much more!
[/list]

Thanks to those changes, "Besmirch Demo" should run more smoothly and will allow for better gameplay!

[h3] What's next[/h3]

We are currently working on a new "Winter Season"...

[img]https://pbs.twimg.com/media/Grj2AVRXAAE0sy3?format=png&name=small[/img]

... as well as taking a deeper look at the Baron's mansion with randomly-generated corridors and rooms. 

[img]https://pbs.twimg.com/media/GrouWHOWcAAvTK2?format=png&name=small[/img]



In addition to that, we'll continue to work on any issues that players encounter.

We appreciate you being here, and we'll see you in the next one!
